* Diodes are for n-type MOS transistors
*
djdb_area 12 11
+ bsim_diode_area
+ area = p_djdb_a
djdb_perim 12 11
+ bsim_diode_perim
+ area = p_djdb_p
djdb_swg 12 11
+ bsim_diode_swg
